@expected CONSUMERS.md
# Consumers

## OrderConsumer

Handles `order.created`. The event payload is:

```ts
type OrderCreatedEvent = {
  orderId: string;
  customerId: string;
  total: number;
};
```

The queue is bound at amqp://rabbitmq.internal:5672/orders/order.created and the consumer is registered last in the DI registry.
